OL,3,GNEWSAHorse-death crash driver gets
OL,4,Asuspended jail term
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 76-year-old motorist with sight
OL,7,Fproblems who drove into a woman in a
OL,8,Fcrash that killed her horse has
OL,9,Freceived a suspended jail sentence.
OL,11,FRider Sophia Bradley, was injured in
OL,12,Fthe collision at Uffington, near
OL,13,FShrewsbury in October 2024, while her
OL,14,Fhorse Ava, wearing full high-visibility
OL,15,Fclothing, died.
OL,17,FDriver John Pearson, who had admitted
OL,18,Fcausing serious injury by dangerous
OL,19,Fdriving, "had a significant known
OL,20,Fvisual impairment" and was not wearing
OL,21,Fthe glasses he needed for driving, West
OL,22,FMercia Police said.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
