OL,5,
OL,6,FSpeaking after sentencing of Pearson,
OL,7,Fof Upton Magna and Bradley said the
OL,8,Fcrash at speed has had a big impact on
OL,9,Fher and the death of Ava meant she had
OL,10,Flost her "best friend".
